                            Development Notes
                            -----------------

BlitzList was developed on a humble A1200 with 10 megs of ram, using BlitzBasic
and tested with my bulletin board, The BackYard. Over 40k of pure source code,
excluding comments, and 2 months work, on and off, have gone into it, and the
amount of testing you would not believe :-)

Essential programs that have helped me create this program, are CED, Dopus,
Multiview, Zeus Bulletin Board, PowerSnap, Master Control Program, Term,
Blitz 2 and the bodgy Ted editor, Cyclone and ye-olde faithfull arexx.

